    "source": "package rules\nimport rego.v1\n\nrule_applies if {\n\tis_number(input.request.year)\n\tinput.request.year > 2020\n\tis_number(input.request.year)\n\tinput.request.year <= 2030\n\tinput.request.lease_days != null\n\tnot input.request.monitor_selection_season_count != null\n\tis_number(input.request.lease_days)\n\tinput.request.lease_days != 30\n\tis_number(input.request.lease_days)\n\tinput.request.lease_days >= 7\n\tis_number(input.request.lease_days)\n\tinput.request.lease_days < 365\n\tinput.request.list.rank == 1\n\tinput.request.quality_profile_name == \"Sample Profile\"\n\tis_string(input.request.monitor_type)\n\tinput.request.monitor_type != \"NONE\"\n\tinput.request.external_ids.imdb != null\n\tnot input.request.external_ids.tvdb != null\n\tnot input.request.preferred_audio_languages != null\n}\n\nmanual if rule_applies\n\nset_monitor := \"FUTURE_EPISODES\" if rule_applies\n",
    "cases": [
